feature: event-infrastructure-dashboard
description: |
  Build Member D's brownfield Event Infrastructure and Dashboard scope: a typed
  EventEmitter2-backed event bus, asynchronous in-memory backtest queue and worker
  pool with retry/dead-letter handling, event-observer leaderboard, bounded strategy
  search loop, Dashboard BFF, WebSocket push gateway, application shell, loop status
  controls, and realtime leaderboard UI. Preserve existing Market Data, Strategy,
  News, chart, and shared code; integrate only through active contracts and shared
  interfaces. Resolve contract/code drift before implementation.
